@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@approveApplicationId = 1
@rejectApplicationId = 2

### 管理员登录（该账号必须已经拥有 ADMIN 角色）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_user_001",
  "password": "Ocean1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set(
        "adminAccessToken",
        response.body.data.accessToken
    );
%}

### 管理员分页查询全部志愿者申请
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 管理员查询待审核申请
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications?status=PENDING&page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 非法状态参数，应返回业务错误 40007
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications?status=UNKNOWN&page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 管理员通过志愿者申请（先把变量改成真实待审核申请 ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications/{{approveApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "reviewComment": "申请资料符合要求"
}

### 管理员拒绝志愿者申请
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications/{{rejectApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "reviewComment": "申请资料不完整"
}

### 拒绝时未填写审批意见，应返回业务错误 40008
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/volunteer-applications/{{rejectApplicationId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}
